{"slug":"Universal-Script-Hitbox-Gui-Universal-46744","_id":"68889ac13e12055133f93269","title":"Hitbox Gui Universal","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"This script allows you to dynamically adjust the hitbox size of enemy players (players who are not on your team or have no team) in Roblox games.\n\nIncrease or decrease hitbox size easily with the GUI buttons.\n\nHitboxes become visible with a neon red glow for better visibility.\n\nAutomatically resets hitboxes to default when disabled.\n\nFriendly teammates’ hitboxes remain unchanged.\n\nUser-friendly draggable interface with toggle (On/Off) button.\n\nLightweight and easy to use.\n\n\nPerfect for competitive gameplay, testing, and training.\n\nScript by AB0OD\nOriginally by XONE (Fly GUI)\n\n▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬▬\n\nسكربت Hitbox GUI بواسطة ABOOD\n\nيسمح لك هذا السكربت بتعديل حجم الهيتبكس للاعبين الخصوم (الذين ليسوا في فريقك أو بدون فريق) بشكل ديناميكي داخل اللعبة.\n\nزيادة أو تقليل حجم الهيتبكس بسهولة عبر واجهة المستخدم.\n\nتظهر الهيتبكس بلون أحمر نيون لسهولة التمييز.\n\nيعيد الهيتبكس لحجمها الافتراضي عند إيقاف السكربت.\n\nلا يؤثر على أعضاء فريقك.\n\nواجهة قابلة للسحب مع زر تشغيل وإيقاف.\n\nخفيف وسهل الاستخدام.\n\n\nمثالي لتحسين التجربة التنافسية والتدريب داخل اللعبة.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TIG0Z/mRXScripts/refs/heads/main/hitbox-1.txt\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2","username":"AB0OD","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9f8f5535968c44f432c33425bbc4c7d31f0c01091231d8506ef2eb4f08983e1e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2-1753782210760.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6611d5d98ef522f25c47b7e2","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"